  "unresolved": [
    "All four .sdata2 facts remain unresolved as section-specific claims. No compiled size, bytes, placement, relocation, or literal-ownership evidence was supplied.",
    "The exact elapsed ReboundStop freeze interval and complete hitlag/scheduler ordering are not established. The callback is unconditional when invoked, but invocation is externally gated.",
    "Exact recovery-frame counts, runtime common constants, animation metadata, and proportionality to raw hitbox damage are not established. The observed denominator is affine in integerized clash damage.",
    "The physical polarity of mpColl_8004B108 and ft_80082708 remains unresolved beyond the explicit true-to-GA_Air mapping and the consumer's literal GA_Ground comparison.",
    "Target floating-point exception modes, denormal handling, rounding, and animation behavior for negative, zero, infinite, or NaN rates are not established. Float-to-int conversion descriptions assume representable inputs.",
